 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "visual-theme-atmosphere",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Tema visual e atmosfera"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<p>Cozy cafe-inspired interface with warm tones, soft typography, and clean layouts for a relaxed browsing experience.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Visual style:</strong> minimal, clean</li><li><strong>Color stance:</strong> primary, neutral, success, warning, danger</li><li><strong>Design intent:</strong> Keep outputs recognizable to this style family while preserving usability and readability.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<p>Interface aconchegante inspirada em cafés, com tons quentes, tipografia suave e layouts limpos para uma navegação tranquila.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Estilo visual:</strong> minimalista, limpo</li><li><strong>Postura de cor:</strong> primária, neutra, sucesso, alerta, perigo</li><li><strong>Intenção de design:</strong> Manter os resultados reconhecíveis como parte desta família de estilo, preservando a usabilidade e a legibilidade.</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "color",
   "title": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "Color"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "Cor"
    }
   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<ul><li><strong>Primary:</strong> <code>#5D4432</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Secondary:</strong> <code>#E9E3DD</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Success:</strong> <code>#16A34A</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Warning:</strong> <code>#D97706</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Danger:</strong> <code>#DC2626</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Surface:</strong> <code>#F9F7F5</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Text:</strong> <code>#3E2B1E</code> — Token from style foundations.</li><li><strong>Neutral:</strong> <code>#F9F7F5</code> — Derived from the surface token for official format compatibility.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Favor Primary (#5D4432) for CTA emphasis.</li><li>Use Surface (#F9F7F5) for large backgrounds and cards.</li><li>Keep body copy on Text (#3E2B1E) for legibility.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
